{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>無綫真人騷《女神配對計劃 2》最新一集引爆全城熱話，陳星妤（Yvette）行使特權換入相識多年的李爾晨（Kyle），觸發二人於鏡頭前淚崩剖白這段長達11年「友達以上」的遺憾過往。節目播出後，Kyle 於社交平台 Threads 發文表白兼為女方送上祝福，並公開二人昔日的青澀合照，隨即引來大批網民湧入留言熱烈討論。曬青澀舊照...</p>\n<p>無綫真人騷《女神配對計劃 2》最新一集引爆全城熱話，陳星妤（Yvette）行使特權換入相識多年的李爾晨（Kyle），觸發二人於鏡頭前淚崩剖白這段長達11年「友達以上」的遺憾過往。節目播出後，Kyle 於社交平台 Threads 發文表白兼為女方送上祝福，並公開二人昔日的青澀合照，隨即引來大批網民湧入留言熱烈討論。</p>\n<h2>曬青澀舊照留下11年深情告白</h2>\n<p>Kyle 在 Threads 上載了當年與 Yvette 在甜品店的舊照，相中兩人面露燦爛笑容，神情青澀親密。Kyle 更留下充滿遺憾卻又真摯的字句：「你未忘 我未忘 猶勝伴在旁。十一年 不敢提起 未敢忘記 你一定要幸福。」文末他更直接標註了 Yvette 的社交帳號 @yvette.cc，公開將埋藏心底多年的心聲展露人前。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179359724421949647_3985918846ae81f3c7c3e4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"86d7365d-10e6-4168-80c3-35f34f6d93d8.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179359724421949647_3985918846ae81f3c7c3e4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>網民心痛嘆「做足11年兵」：咁靚仔都要當兵？</h2>\n<p>貼文曝光後，網民的反應相當兩極，不少人戥 Kyle 感到心痛與不值，直指這段關係宛如「做足11年兵」<b><strong>，</strong></b> 網民紛紛感嘆「咁靚仔都要做兵🥹」、「做10年兵？！無錢點會簡你…」、「陰公，好仔無好下場架，建議唔好咁專一，包你有女朋友」、「一個士兵，司令如好好帶領，未來或會榮獲晉升五顆星」。亦有網民留言苦勸他不要再深陷其中：「師兄希望你唔好再沉落去，唔好做兵。人地都講左佢係想你陪喺佢身邊，佢冇話想同你喺埋一齊」、「唔好做兵呀，快啲搵過個」、「何必」、「咁勢利恐怖女仔，早走！」。</p>\n<h2>力撐放膽跨前一步 vs 驚嘆女方「外貌進化」</h2>\n<p>除了同情與勸退外，亦有部分網民認為二人當年情愫極深，紛紛留言力撐 Kyle 鼓起勇氣追求幸福：「如果擺唔低就不如誠實d一齊，無謂等老左嘅自己後悔，拋開一切，幸福先最重要」、「哩d相跟談了有什麼區別」、「第一張咁都無路？」。</p>\n<p>與此同時，隨着二人當年的合照曝光，部分網民將焦點轉移至外貌變化上，留言指：「個女都唔同樣ge……進化左咁多….」、「佢個樣係咪照住Jessica調整😂」，更有人打趣表示：「但男人好似退化左」。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179354157447660455_9622432866ae745c6ab3e0.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"media-1\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179354157447660455_9622432866ae745c6ab3e0.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179354155002446876_42478206ae745ae696c7.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179354155002446876_42478206ae745ae696c7.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>陳星妤此時突然控制不住情緒哽咽落淚，坦言好少有人在身邊陪伴多年，入行及人生重大決定都會詢問對方意見，期望這段關係可以一直維持下去。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179359724554866820_4204917136ae81f3dbc7d0.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"883080586_18635903860017387_5139677892251616819_n.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179359724554866820_4204917136ae81f3dbc7d0.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179359724652963376_20133716946ae81f3eba3ca.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"884669346_18635903872017387_2156254292879566727_n.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179359724652963376_20133716946ae81f3eba3ca.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179359724823916097_10923555266ae81f406bdbb.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"881593654_18635903890017387_1493573474564906306_n.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179359724823916097_10923555266ae81f406bdbb.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179359724982282450_14833104956ae81f42033c8.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"886677168_18635903917017387_7997469906763038676_n.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179359724982282450_14833104956ae81f42033c8.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179359725131183438_6466946866ae81f4374e97.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"885265091_18635903881017387_5967313547001938253_n.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179359725131183438_6466946866ae81f4374e97.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179359725210939642_1976528266ae81f444745c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"883033637_18635903863017387_146180555056439082_n.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179359725210939642_1976528266ae81f444745c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T05:40:46.101447+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1401,"images":9,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T05:27:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T07:38:42.407543+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T05:38:15.992232+00:00","content_hash":"787ebe740c98b1f0938c0d3b4dc8128e44c8c0cc31cd48cb6d3a64a50482ccb2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}